cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this framework, please cite it as below."
title: "FINOS AI Governance Framework"
abstract: >-
  The FINOS AI Governance Framework (AIGF) is an open catalogue of risks and
  mitigations for on-boarding, developing and running AI systems in financial
  services, with a focus on generative and agentic AI. Each risk and mitigation
  is mapped to regulations, standards and guidance, including the EU AI Act,
  NIST AI 600-1, NIST SP 800-53, ISO/IEC 42001, the OWASP Top 10 for LLM and
  Agentic Applications and the FFIEC IT booklets. The framework also contains a
  heuristic method to find the risks that apply to a use case, and a set of
  worked use cases. It is developed in the open by the members and contributors
  of FINOS, the Fintech Open Source Foundation.
